@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundcolor #E6F0FF
skinparam sequence {
    Actor BackgroundColor #BBDDFF
    Actor BorderColor #0000FF
    LifeLine BorderColor #0000FF
    LifeLine BackgroundColor #ACE1FF
    Participant BackgroundColor #BBDDFF
    Participant BorderColor #0000FF
    Message {
        BackgroundColor #BBDDFF
        BorderColor #0000FF
    }
    Signature {
        BackgroundColor #FFF
        FontColor #0000FF
    }
}

actor User
participant Camera
participant "AI Server" as AIServer
participant "Vector Database" as VectorDB

autonumber

User -> Camera: Stand in front of the camera
Camera -> Camera: Capture face frame
Camera -> AIServer: Send captured face
AIServer -> AIServer: Encode face embedding
AIServer -> VectorDB: Search person identity
VectorDB --> AIServer: Return identity result
AIServer --> Camera: Send result
Camera -> Camera: Turn LED green if person is in system

@enduml